;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; Coding informations
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C0,J285 - Instrument cluster
C1,??x01 - Equipment variations
C2,+00 - 1. K-Number (Europe, USA, Rest of World)
C3,+01 - Smaller fuel tank volume (All wheel drive)
C4,+02 - Seatbelt warning (NAR old - NOT USA from 45/2004)
C5,+04 - 3. K-Number (rental cars)
C6,+08 - 2. K-Number (Australia)
C7, 
C8,xx?01 - Country variations
C9,0 - Germany (D) / 1 - Rest of World (RoW)
C10,2 - USA (US) / 3 - Canada (CDN)
C11,4 - Great Britain (GB) / 5 - Japan (JP)
C12,6 - Arabic states / 7 - Australia (AUS)
C13, 
C14,xxx?1: Seatbelt warning (USA only | 45/2004 >)
C15,3 - Seatbelt warning (NAR new)
C16,
C17,Note: The speedometer lead or distance driven lead is set with the K-number. 
C18,PR-9P1 - Seatbelt warning (E-contact in belt lock)
C19,PR-9P5 - Seatbelt warning (optical and acoustic / E-contact in belt lock)
C20,PR-F4F - Rental car equipment
;
